### Interactive & Reduced-Motion Contract

- **Play/Pause (`[data-mech-toggle]`):** `>= 44×44px` button with `aria-pressed` and visible `:focus-visible` ring. Toggles `data-paused="true"` on `.mech-figure` (freezing CSS `stroke-dashoffset` and pulse keyframes via `animation-play-state: paused`), calls `svg.pauseAnimations()` / `svg.unpauseAnimations()` when available, and announces state changes in the `aria-live="polite"` `<figcaption>`.
- **Keyboard Stage Focus:** All four stages (`Producer`, `Queue`, `Worker`, `Retry DLQ`) are focusable both via toolbar stage buttons and directly inside `<svg>` (`tabindex="0" role="button"` with a visible `3px` `.node-focus-ring`). Arrow keys (`ArrowLeft`/`ArrowRight`/`ArrowUp`/`ArrowDown`), `Home`, `End`, `Enter`/`Space`, and `Escape` step through or reset stages while keeping non-active stages readable (`opacity: 0.56`) and updating the `aria-live="polite"` status caption.
- **Theme Sync & Toggle:** Automatically tracks `@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark)` and supports manual toggling via `:root[data-theme="dark"]` / `:root[data-theme="light"]`, updating canvas, gradients, grid dots, markers, tracks, and text fills without modifying SVG attributes.
- **Reduced Motion (`@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`):** Disables continuous signal travel and pulse animations (`animation: none !important; animation-play-state: paused !important;`) while keeping directional arrowheads, numbered stage badges (`Step 1`–`Step 3`, `Branch`), edge pills, and the lower-left flow legend visible for complete static comprehension.

